@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@productId = 1
@customerId = 1

### 读取当前主体可见的实体文档契约
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-doc/contract
Accept: application/json

### 创建商品：通用 CRUD
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "options": {"requestId": "commerce-product-create-1"},
  "payload": {
    "name": "实体编程入门书",
    "price": 19.90,
    "active": true
  }
}

### 创建客户：通用 CRUD
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/customer/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "options": {"requestId": "commerce-customer-create-1"},
  "payload": {
    "displayName": "Ada Lovelace",
    "email": "ada@example.com"
  }
}

### 下单：内置 Command Controller 路由到业务 Handler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/action/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": {
    "customerId": {{customerId}},
    "items": [
      {"productId": {{productId}}, "quantity": 2}
    ]
  }
}

### 查询订单及明细：内置 Query Controller 路由到业务 Handler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail/detail
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"filter": {"id": 1}}}

### 默认订单创建未授权，预期 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/create
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload": {"customerId": {{customerId}}}}


### 可售商品分页：场景补充 active=true，默认引擎执行过滤、排序和分页
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/page/saleable
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "options": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10,
    "sorts": [{"field": "price", "direction": "ASC"}]
  }
}

### 条件取交集：不能用 active=false 绕过可售场景，预期空页
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/page/saleable
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"filter": {"active": false}}}

### 普通管理分页：包含停用商品
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/product/page
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"page": 1, "limit": 10}}
